  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FW-GPCR-Lattakia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen social cohesion and promote inclusive local governance in Lattakia during Syria&#x2019;s fragile transition phase. It addresses rising tensions, weakened institutions, and declining public trust by empowering municipalities to deliver equitable and gender-responsive services while facilitating inclusive community dialogue and conflict resolution. The initiative focuses on enhancing women&#x2019;s and youth participation in decision-making, expanding access to justice through community-based mechanisms, and supporting peacebuilding efforts that address root causes of division. By combining governance reform, civic engagement, and protection services, the project seeks to rebuild trust between communities and local authorities, reduce conflict risks, and lay the foundation for sustainable peace and recovery</narrative>
  </description>
